      "updated": 1752278400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE HIDDEN\nBOTTLENECK\nNew topic = GitHub\nPR + Atlantis +\nTerraform + on-call\nmanual approval by\nemail. SLA: 2 days.\nLaunches: 20+ PRs/hr,\nmissed emails =\ntimed-out requests.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b_s4",
      "originalText": "THE HIDDEN\nBOTTLENECK\nNew topic = GitHub\nPR + Atlantis +\nTerraform + on-call\nmanual approval by\nemail. SLA: 2 days.\nLaunches: 20+ PRs/hr,\nmissed emails =\ntimed-out requests.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
